<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0671_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jose</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tweet! Tweeeeeet!\rIf my FARFETCH’D see anythin’ shiny,\nit go snatch it.\rYou like shiny things?\nI could share if it get some more.\rHow ’bout we swap numbers?\nI’ll call if it find anythin’. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll hit you as soon as I get\nsomethin’ shiny.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You sure? Well, lmk if you\nchange your mind.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tweet! Tweeeeeet!\nYou like shiny things?\rI could share if FARFETCH’D go\nsnatch more.\rYou gon’ gimme your\nnumber? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tweet! Tweeeeeet!\rHuh?\r...Oh, I see.\nI thought you came over ’cause\fyou was feelin’ my whistlin’.\rThat ain’t it. You just came for the\nStar Piece, didn’t you? Here you go!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tweet! Tweeeeeet!\r...Huh? Wait, don’t tell me you\ncallin’ from right nearby?\rWell, come closer and\ntalk in person!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo listen, my {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}’s stalk\ngot this REAL delicious smell.\rThat smell get me hungry!\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A while ago, my FARFETCH’D knocked out\nthis {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}. You shoulda\fseen FARFETCH’D swing that stalk.\rCrazy stuff!\nLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I ran into a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}...\rI was tryna catch it, but it\ndipped faster than I thought.\fKinda disappointin’.\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wanna scrap again?\rFor some reason, my FARFETCH’D all\nworked up and ready to go.\r{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} is where I’m at.\nKeep a eye out for me, OK?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, could you hurry over?\nFARFETCH’D is HEATED.\rIf you don’t come soon, it might smack\nme with its stalk!\r{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!\nCome ASAP!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, could you hurry over?\nFARFETCH’D is HEATED.\rIf you don’t come soon, it might smack\nme with its stalk!\r{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!\nCome ASAP!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I ain’t got what I promised\nyou yet.\rI’ll hit you as soon as I get it, so\ncould you wait a lil longer?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My FARFETCH’D had somethin’ shiny in\nits beak.\rLike I promised, you can have it.\rCatch me on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0},\nand it’s yours.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0671_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What’s wrong?\nYou don’t want this gift?\rCatch me on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0},\nand it’s yours.</language>
	</row>
</body>
